    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73391" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμάκοοι</span></b> , οἱ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμός, ἀκούω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fellow-hearers, fellow-students</i> in the
			Pythagorean school, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>VP</u>
				17.73
			</span></i> :—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμακοεῖον</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμακόϊον</span></b> , τό, <i>the
			school</i> of Pythagoreans, ib.<i><span class="en">
				6.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>VP</u>
				20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Olymp.
				<u>in Alc.</u>
				p.132
			</span></i> C. :—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμάϊον</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Hierocl.
				<u>in CA</u>
				27p.484M.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				856.63
			</span></i>.</div>
